Licensing for the game content in this directory tree
=====================================================

Vortex Arena redistributes the Xonotic content set directly (it is committed to the
game repository rather than downloaded at build time). These are the licence documents
that content arrives under, copied unmodified from the upstream Xonotic distribution:

  COPYING.xonotic   Team Xonotic's licensing document, verbatim. It grants GPL version 3
                    or any later version for all source files in its scope, which covers
                    official Xonotic releases and Team Xonotic-owned branches of
                    git://git.xonotic.org/xonotic/ — the origin of this content.
  GPL-3             GPL version 3. The licence the grant above points at.
  GPL-2             GPL version 2. Included because COPYING.xonotic states both texts are
                    "provided in the files GPL-2 and GPL-3 in this package", and because
                    the "or any later version" clause makes the v2 text part of the grant.

Attribution for the contributors who authored this content is carried in the game's
credits screen (game/menu/CreditsScreen.cs), a verbatim port of upstream's
qcsrc/menu/xonotic/credits.qc.

The licence for Vortex Arena's own source code is a separate matter — see COPYING at
the repository root.

Why this directory exists: before the repo restructure the content was fetched by
download-assets.sh and never committed, so the licence texts stayed in the upstream
checkout and travelled with nothing. Now that we redistribute the content, the licence
has to travel with it. See planning/repo-restructure-2026-07-29.md D1/D2 and section 10.
